  data: {
    LLM: "Win each round by being the first team to play all tiles (empty hand), or when the game is blocked, have the lowest total spots on unplayed tiles. Win a set number of rounds in a row (e.g. 4 or 6) to win the match.\n\n7 tiles each (4p). Highest double leads. Match ends; if can't play draw from boneyard. Pass when blocked. First team empty or lowest at block wins.",
